\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Released systems and our strategies on the same papers and model (means over entries; exploratory). Facts: OMIM facts conveyed, credited to paragraphs citing the paper; stated, not stated: restricted by whether the supplied text states the fact (a model judgement). Characters written, model calls and list price are per entry for generation; the strategies' cost excludes their audit and repair round (\$0.93--\$1.21 per entry on the 4 entries). Supported: claims judged supported in an audit without repair (for the strategies, their audit before repair). PaperQA2: document-query pipeline without its agent; GraphRAG: local search. Intervals, tests and GraphRAG's global search: Appendix~\ref {app:r2_ext}.}}{9}{table.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:released}{{3}{9}{Released systems and our strategies on the same papers and model (means over entries; exploratory). Facts: OMIM facts conveyed, credited to paragraphs citing the paper; stated, not stated: restricted by whether the supplied text states the fact (a model judgement). Characters written, model calls and list price are per entry for generation; the strategies' cost excludes their audit and repair round (\$0.93--\$1.21 per entry on the 4 entries). Supported: claims judged supported in an audit without repair (for the strategies, their audit before repair). PaperQA2: document-query pipeline without its agent; GraphRAG: local search. Intervals, tests and GraphRAG's global search: Appendix~\ref {app:r2_ext}}{table.3}{}}
