\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {43}{\ignorespaces Audit on planted errors (30 items per class), counts over items whose truth is known by construction. Planted claim flagged: at least one planted claim unsupported or contradicted. Control: the same paragraph unaltered, re-audited fresh. An added citation is expected to pass (a claim takes the best verdict over its cited papers), and so is an omission (the audit judges only what is written). Truth not known (the variant occurs in the new paper's text): 4 same-entry swaps (paragraph flagged 4) and 5 moved sentences (paragraph flagged 5; the control's analogue of the planted claim flagged 4 of 5). Bottom: verdict on the worst planted claim per item.}}{44}{table.43}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:app_audit_classes}{{43}{44}{Audit on planted errors (30 items per class), counts over items whose truth is known by construction. Planted claim flagged: at least one planted claim unsupported or contradicted. Control: the same paragraph unaltered, re-audited fresh. An added citation is expected to pass (a claim takes the best verdict over its cited papers), and so is an omission (the audit judges only what is written). Truth not known (the variant occurs in the new paper's text): 4 same-entry swaps (paragraph flagged 4) and 5 moved sentences (paragraph flagged 5; the control's analogue of the planted claim flagged 4 of 5). Bottom: verdict on the worst planted claim per item}{table.43}{}}
